{"id":"n25986-1-8","stage":1,"title":"주차 · 停车","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25986-1-8-1","ko":"이곳은 주차 금지 구역입니다.","zh":"这里是禁止停车的区域。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이곳은","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"이곳：这里，这儿；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"이곳","audio":"/audio/f7b06733762a4646c18b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71130","senseId":"1","lemma":"이곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주차","meaning":"停车，停放车辆","explanation":"주차：停车，停放车辆","readings":[{"term":"주차","audio":"/audio/402473b26294876f2ebe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25986","senseId":"1","lemma":"주차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"금지","meaning":"禁止","explanation":"금지：禁止","readings":[{"term":"금지","audio":"/audio/c019e0d89b7506f26a52.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41234","senseId":"1","lemma":"금지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"구역입니다.","meaning":"区域","explanation":"구역：区域；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"구역","audio":"/audio/366e0bfa41c1dcd36a2d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24546","senseId":"1","lemma":"구역","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f7b06733762a4646","term":"이곳","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/f7b06733762a4646c18b.mp3","entryId":"71130","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["이곧"]},{"id":"402473b26294876f","term":"주차","zh":"停车，停放车辆","audio":"/audio/402473b26294876f2ebe.mp3","entryId":"25986","definition":"把汽车等停在一定的地方。","pronunciation":["주ː차"]},{"id":"c019e0d89b7506f2","term":"금지","zh":"禁止","audio":"/audio/c019e0d89b7506f26a52.mp3","entryId":"41234","definition":"以法律、条例或命令的形式不允许做某种行为。","pronunciation":["금ː지"]},{"id":"366e0bfa41c1dcd3","term":"구역","zh":"区域","audio":"/audio/366e0bfa41c1dcd36a2d.mp3","entryId":"24546","definition":"按照一定基准或特性划分的多个区中的一个。","pronunciation":["구역"]}],"audio":"/audio/bf17b3971bf8f3830b3f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n25986-1-8-2","ko":"그렇군요. 그럼 제가 다른 곳에 차를 대겠습니다.","zh":"原来如此。那我就把车停到别的地方吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그렇군요.","meaning":"那样，一般","explanation":"그렇다：那样，一般；군요：对新发现或新理解的情况表示礼貌的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"5","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제가","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"곳에","meaning":"地方，地区","explanation":"곳：地方，地区；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"곳","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18661","senseId":"1","lemma":"곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"차를","meaning":"车，车辆","explanation":"차：车，车辆；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"차","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62525","senseId":"1","lemma":"차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"대겠습니다.","meaning":"靠，停","explanation":"대다：靠，停；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"대다","audio":"/audio/37e6cd2a79f4d7f6bf25.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88105","senseId":"5","lemma":"대다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样，一般","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"不好或不太满意。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"f1f4ce417552e197","term":"다른","zh":"其他，别的","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3","entryId":"64530","definition":"除相关之外的。","pronunciation":["다른"]},{"id":"24875f860934407b","term":"곳","zh":"地方，地区","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3","entryId":"18661","definition":"一个特定的地点或位置。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"6ccd3f82b0317e51","term":"차","zh":"车，车辆","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3","entryId":"62525","definition":"搬运人或行李的带轮子的机械。","pronunciation":["차"]},{"id":"37e6cd2a79f4d7f6","term":"대다","zh":"靠，停","audio":"/audio/37e6cd2a79f4d7f6bf25.mp3","entryId":"88105","definition":"使车、船等交通工具停住。","pronunciation":["대ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/71e7911835b6241dfb0f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.995,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=25986","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":32,"sequenceScore":1.5471,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["原来如此。那我就把车停到别的地方吧。","这里原本有的铅笔，你没看见吗？","这里是禁止停车的区域。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["原来如此。那我就把车停到别的地方吧。","这里是禁止停车的区域。","这里原本有的铅笔，你没看见吗？"],"answer":0}]}
